# Generate m17 L17 b04 staircase scene asset

Generated `course-assets/scenes/module-17/m17_L17_b04_staircase.png` from the built-in image generation workflow using the requested gpt-image-2 prompt and supplied BMH doodle references.

The first candidate had the right subject but used 3D block perspective and gradients, so I rerolled with a stricter flat side-view prompt. The selected candidate was then resized and hard-mapped to the locked flat palette before saving the final PNG.

## Verification

- `file course-assets/scenes/module-17/m17_L17_b04_staircase.png` reports PNG image data at 1600 x 900.
- `sips -g pixelWidth -g pixelHeight course-assets/scenes/module-17/m17_L17_b04_staircase.png` reports 1600 x 900.
- Local palette check reports exactly five RGB colors: `#62b3f3`, black, sunflower yellow, pale cream, and money green.
- Visual inspection confirms four rising steps, the top cash stack is taller than the second-step cash stack, the upper-left blue space is clean, and there are no people, faces, text, symbols, labels, ambient doodles, or decorative clutter.
- `git check-ignore -v course-assets/scenes/module-17/m17_L17_b04_staircase.png` confirms the saved asset is under the existing `course-assets/` ignore rule.

